      "worked": "The centre is $O=(0,0)$. For $P=(3,4)$,\n$$\\begin{align*}m_{OP}&=\\frac{4-0}{3-0}\\\\m_{OP}&=\\frac43.\\end{align*}$$\nThe tangent is perpendicular to $OP$, so its gradient is the negative reciprocal:\n$$m_t=-\\frac34.$$\nThe tangent passes through $(3,4)$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y-4&=-\\frac34(x-3)\\\\4y-16&=-3x+9\\\\3x+4y&=25.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
